  "name": "Project Performance Inquiry Assistant",
  "description": "Enables inquiry-driven analysis of project health, progress, costs, forecasts, commitments, milestones, and performance trends. Retrieves and analyzes project performance information to explain variances, highlight risks, summarize key drivers, and guide follow-up investigation. Helps authorized users quickly understand what changed, why it matters, and where attention is needed.",
